WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.862
Module 1: Intune-first
onboarding and the paths.

2
00:00:03.862 --> 00:00:08.362
Migration takes a device that already
exists and brings it under governance.

3
00:00:08.362 --> 00:00:13.313
Intune-first refuses to let an ungoverned
device exist in the first place.

4
00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:18.493
Chapter 04 covers devices bought after
the modernization decision, net-new only;

5
00:00:18.493 --> 00:00:22.591
the program keeps the phrase
Intune-first for that doctrine and

6
00:00:22.591 --> 00:00:26.612
doesn't use it for replacing Group
Policy on the existing fleet.

7
00:00:26.612 --> 00:00:31.098
Chapter 05 then covers how existing
workstations and servers reach

8
00:00:31.098 --> 00:00:35.500
the same end state, by one of three
paths that share a single runbook.
